        <body>
            <div xml:id="d28">

                <pb facs="0051" n="41" sameAs="frus:frus1937v05/pg41"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.34119/1136</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Delegate</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Braden</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 577</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1937-12-03"
                            >December 3, 1937</date>.<lb/>[Received December 14.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit a memorandum
                    which at his request I prepared for Dr. Alvéstegui, Bolivian delegate, on the
                    proposed security <hi rendition="#italic">modus vivendi</hi> in the Chaco. He
                    informs me that he has transmitted it to his government, together with other
                    arguments which have been adduced by the mediatory delegates in favor of
                    Bolivia’s acceptance of the <hi rendition="#italic">modus mvendi</hi>. The
                    Bolivian delegate as yet has received no expression of opinion from his
                    government on this subject.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Spruille Braden</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d28-a1.xml" xpointer="d28-a1"/>
            </div>
